    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperate with a friend to overcome obstacles using a grappling hook and an air gun!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012760/extras/b828813e31c679dff94b2cf20dcb930f.avif?t=1743064286\" data-has-big width=800 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a mysterious <strong>super lab</strong> managed by an enigmatic robot, you and your <u>friend</u> (probably) have become <u>voluntary</u> test subjects (probably).<br>With an <strong>air gun</strong> and a <strong>grappling hook</strong>, you must work together to navigate the robot\u2019s challenging obstacle courses!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use each character\u2019s unique abilities to overcome tricky situations and enjoy a <strong>fun, lighthearted co-op platforming experience!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>2-Player Co-op</strong> \u2013 Team up with a friend to solve puzzles and conquer obstacles!<br>\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Physics-Based Interactions</strong> \u2013 Manipulate objects, characters, and the environment freely!<br>\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Casual yet Engaging Platforming &amp; Puzzles</strong> \u2013 A balanced difficulty for stress-free enjoyment!<br>\ud83d\udc23 <strong>Adorable and Unique Characters &amp; Objects</strong> \u2013 A charming world that brings a smile to your face!<br>\ud83d\ude06 <strong>Dark Humor with a Comedic Twist</strong> \u2013 Silly yet strangely relatable moments!<br>\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Creative Physics-Based Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Utilize each character\u2019s abilities in inventive ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creative Character Abilities with Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012760/extras/71da8545e3d8560c62ed3ef0dedad6dc.poster.avif?t=1743064286\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012760/extras/71da8545e3d8560c62ed3ef0dedad6dc.webm?t=1743064286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012760/extras/71da8545e3d8560c62ed3ef0dedad6dc.mp4?t=1743064286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leverage each character\u2019s unique skills for innovative, physics-driven gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interact with Various Objects!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012760/extras/b8293ec2b1b8cf921713646a430f8fa4.poster.avif?t=1743064286\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012760/extras/b8293ec2b1b8cf921713646a430f8fa4.webm?t=1743064286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012760/extras/b8293ec2b1b8cf921713646a430f8fa4.mp4?t=1743064286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use diverse objects scattered throughout the stages to clear obstacles and progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...And stay tuned for <strong>even more features and content in future updates!</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperate with a friend to overcome obstacles using a grappling hook and an air gun!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012760/extras/b828813e31c679dff94b2cf20dcb930f.avif?t=1743064286\" data-has-big width=800 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a mysterious <strong>super lab</strong> managed by an enigmatic robot, you and your <u>friend</u> (probably) have become <u>voluntary</u> test subjects (probably).<br>With an <strong>air gun</strong> and a <strong>grappling hook</strong>, you must work together to navigate the robot\u2019s challenging obstacle courses!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use each character\u2019s unique abilities to overcome tricky situations and enjoy a <strong>fun, lighthearted co-op platforming experience!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>2-Player Co-op</strong> \u2013 Team up with a friend to solve puzzles and conquer obstacles!<br>\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Physics-Based Interactions</strong> \u2013 Manipulate objects, characters, and the environment freely!<br>\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Casual yet Engaging Platforming &amp; Puzzles</strong> \u2013 A balanced difficulty for stress-free enjoyment!<br>\ud83d\udc23 <strong>Adorable and Unique Characters &amp; Objects</strong> \u2013 A charming world that brings a smile to your face!<br>\ud83d\ude06 <strong>Dark Humor with a Comedic Twist</strong> \u2013 Silly yet strangely relatable moments!<br>\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Creative Physics-Based Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Utilize each character\u2019s abilities in inventive ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creative Character Abilities with Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012760/extras/71da8545e3d8560c62ed3ef0dedad6dc.poster.avif?t=1743064286\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012760/extras/71da8545e3d8560c62ed3ef0dedad6dc.webm?t=1743064286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012760/extras/71da8545e3d8560c62ed3ef0dedad6dc.mp4?t=1743064286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leverage each character\u2019s unique skills for innovative, physics-driven gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interact with Various Objects!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012760/extras/b8293ec2b1b8cf921713646a430f8fa4.poster.avif?t=1743064286\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012760/extras/b8293ec2b1b8cf921713646a430f8fa4.webm?t=1743064286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012760/extras/b8293ec2b1b8cf921713646a430f8fa4.mp4?t=1743064286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use diverse objects scattered throughout the stages to clear obstacles and progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...And stay tuned for <strong>even more features and content in future updates!</strong></h2>",
    "short_description": "You and your friend are test subjects (?) in a super lab run by a mysterious robot! With an air gun and a grappling hook, cooperate to overcome its obstacle courses. Use each character\u2019s unique abilities to tackle challenges and enjoy a fun, chaotic co-op platformer in a cute and casual world!",
